WEBVTT

01:57.920 --> 02:00.360
Chengcheng became a doctor.

02:02.280 --> 02:04.080
Will she be exposed?

02:06.000 --> 02:07.680
It's a private clinic.

02:08.560 --> 02:09.919
I've told them in advance.

02:10.000 --> 02:11.320
Don't worry.

02:24.640 --> 02:26.320
I'm cured.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.200
Sorry.

02:32.120 --> 02:33.120
Let's go.

02:35.280 --> 02:36.360
Goodbye.

03:02.360 --> 03:03.280
Goodbye.

03:06.120 --> 03:07.120
See you never.

04:42.720 --> 04:47.400
SPECIALTY RECOMMENDATION
BRAISED BEEF TENDON WITH SECRET SAUCE

05:03.000 --> 05:05.560
SPECIALTY RECOMMENDATION
BRAISED BEEF TENDON WITH SECRET SAUCE

05:32.960 --> 05:37.720
NO PARKING, ILLEGAL PARKING MONITORED

07:20.240 --> 07:24.040
THE BOND BAR

07:51.400 --> 07:52.720
THE BOND BAR

07:52.800 --> 07:53.800
MI YOGA, INSHAN GYM

08:46.360 --> 08:47.320
What's wrong with you?

08:47.400 --> 08:49.600
You only got dumped.
Do you have to die for this?

08:49.680 --> 08:51.320
Ask anyone on the street.

08:51.400 --> 08:52.720
Who hasn't been dumped before?

08:52.800 --> 08:54.240
You usually look decent,

08:54.320 --> 08:56.200
but you're so immature and irrational.

09:10.000 --> 09:13.680
It's okay. You can cry.

09:13.760 --> 09:15.640
It's okay to cry for getting dumped,

09:15.720 --> 09:18.080
but you shouldn't die for this, okay?

09:37.240 --> 09:38.520
Tang Qi?

09:40.040 --> 09:40.920
Tang Qi?

09:44.000 --> 09:45.480
I didn't want to die.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.320
I just didn't notice

09:49.400 --> 09:51.360
the traffic light turned red.

09:57.120 --> 09:58.080
Thank you.

09:59.680 --> 10:00.800
I'm fine now.

10:01.520 --> 10:02.680
You can leave.

10:18.360 --> 10:20.560
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed

10:20.640 --> 10:22.320
cannot be connected for the moment.

10:22.400 --> 10:23.600
Please try again later.

11:17.680 --> 11:18.920
Why are you back again?

11:20.160 --> 11:21.000
It started to rain.

11:21.080 --> 11:22.280
You don't have an umbrella.

11:22.360 --> 11:23.240
I'll walk with you.

11:24.800 --> 11:25.840
No need.

11:27.040 --> 11:28.080
Green light.

11:28.600 --> 11:31.400
I just remembered I had something to do.
Same direction.

11:33.440 --> 11:35.120
Well, thank you.

11:35.200 --> 11:36.400
It's okay. Let's go.

12:15.920 --> 12:16.880
You…

12:18.120 --> 12:19.960
Why don't you watch the road?

12:21.040 --> 12:23.800
The manhole isn't properly covered.
It's dangerous.

12:35.080 --> 12:36.600
The umbrella is orange.

12:42.880 --> 12:43.720
Okay.

13:04.600 --> 13:05.760
Hello.

13:07.600 --> 13:09.360
At the intersection of Heping Road
and Chunguang Road,

13:09.440 --> 13:11.240
the manhole isn't covered.

13:11.320 --> 13:12.720
People might get hurt.

13:12.800 --> 13:14.400
Please send someone to fix it.

13:15.400 --> 13:17.280
Yes, people might get hurt.

13:17.840 --> 13:19.280
Tang Qi is so kind.

13:19.360 --> 13:20.520
Okay, thanks.

13:23.440 --> 13:25.560
- Let's go.
- Wait a minute.

13:41.080 --> 13:42.520
Okay, thanks.

13:50.200 --> 13:51.480
That's Tang Qi.

14:10.400 --> 14:12.360
I said I didn't want to die.

14:12.440 --> 14:14.720
You don't pause in the middle.

14:14.800 --> 14:16.560
Once you get home, I'll leave.

14:22.760 --> 14:25.000
It seems we scared her.

14:29.520 --> 14:31.680
XINYUAN GROCERY STORE

14:31.760 --> 14:34.880
Did you see a girl in red pass by?

14:44.480 --> 14:45.600
She went that way.

14:45.680 --> 14:46.560
Thanks.

14:54.600 --> 14:56.640
Didn't you say her?

14:56.720 --> 14:58.520
The girl who got scared

14:58.600 --> 15:00.120
was in red.

15:03.040 --> 15:04.600
I was absent-minded

15:04.680 --> 15:06.160
and didn't notice her clothes.

15:18.600 --> 15:20.320
Now that you're safe at home, I'll leave.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.800
Su Chengcheng.

15:21.880 --> 15:22.960
What's wrong?

15:25.600 --> 15:26.640
Do you want to come in?

15:32.720 --> 15:34.080
Are you really not going to invite me in?

15:35.280 --> 15:36.200
No.

15:37.760 --> 15:39.040
I'm already here.

15:39.120 --> 15:41.240
Aren't you bored alone?
I can chat with you.

15:48.880 --> 15:51.520
I have a dryer and a hairdryer.

15:51.600 --> 15:53.680
You can dry your hair and clothes.

15:55.040 --> 15:57.440
No need. I'll just head home.

15:57.520 --> 15:59.000
It's in another direction.

15:59.640 --> 16:01.480
Your body is weak,
so you might catch a cold.

16:02.880 --> 16:04.360
If you get caught in the rain,

16:04.440 --> 16:05.840
you'll take a day off on Monday.

16:08.160 --> 16:10.440
You knew I was lying.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.640
Thank you for taking me home.

16:19.600 --> 16:20.560
Then I won't be polite.

16:24.160 --> 16:25.880
Actually, I'm quite healthy.

16:25.960 --> 16:28.160
I took days off because of emergencies.

16:28.240 --> 16:29.840
I promise I won't do it again.

17:04.800 --> 17:06.520
Go to the bathroom
to change the wet clothes.

17:06.599 --> 17:08.240
- Okay.
- The bathroom is…

17:13.280 --> 17:14.280
over there.

17:18.839 --> 17:20.920
The layouts of redecorated old houses

17:21.000 --> 17:22.880
are pretty much the same.

17:22.960 --> 17:25.440
I went to my friend's house before.
I know where the bathroom is.

17:26.960 --> 17:28.280
Oh.

17:36.840 --> 17:38.120
The laundry room is next door.

17:39.080 --> 17:40.760
- And the dryer is inside.
- Okay.

17:45.560 --> 17:47.000
Here's the hairdryer.

17:48.960 --> 17:49.960
The towel is clean.

17:50.040 --> 17:51.680
- I didn't use it.
- Thanks.

18:18.800 --> 18:19.920
I didn't want to die.

18:21.280 --> 18:24.440
I just didn't notice
the traffic light turned red.

18:26.120 --> 18:29.200
He really didn't notice that?

18:29.280 --> 18:30.840
I was overthinking it.

18:30.920 --> 18:32.360
He didn't want to die.

18:34.720 --> 18:36.840
I'm a tetrachromat.

18:36.920 --> 18:39.560
We can see a hundred times more colors

18:39.640 --> 18:41.880
than common people do.

18:45.560 --> 18:48.600
Did you see a girl in red pass by?

18:55.200 --> 18:58.120
Oh no. Something's wrong with his eyes.

19:11.080 --> 19:12.280
I'm sure you didn't have dinner.

19:12.360 --> 19:15.480
It takes time to dry the clothes.
We can eat something.

19:17.520 --> 19:18.560
Thanks.

19:28.320 --> 19:30.040
It's just simple food,

19:30.120 --> 19:31.520
but at least he can cook,

19:31.600 --> 19:33.320
so his eyesight is fine.

19:34.200 --> 19:36.120
Can't he see colors clearly?

19:44.760 --> 19:45.720
I'm sorry.

19:46.480 --> 19:47.440
I didn't notice it.

19:47.520 --> 19:49.680
It got stained when I was drawing.

19:50.600 --> 19:51.520
I washed the clothes,

19:51.600 --> 19:53.800
but I couldn't clean the color.

19:53.880 --> 19:54.720
I'll get another one.

19:54.800 --> 19:56.120
No need.

19:56.200 --> 19:57.320
Just a little paint.

19:57.400 --> 19:59.440
I need to change back
into my clothes later anyway.

20:01.280 --> 20:02.560
Let's eat.

20:13.240 --> 20:14.480
Then I'll eat.

20:18.120 --> 20:20.960
He can see the color.

20:21.040 --> 20:24.040
Was I overthinking it again?

20:43.760 --> 20:44.600
What's wrong?

20:48.160 --> 20:49.000
You don't like it?

20:49.080 --> 20:51.400
Oh no. I have a really good appetite.

20:51.480 --> 20:52.640
I like everything.

22:37.080 --> 22:39.560
Why is he imitating the way I eat?

22:40.120 --> 22:42.440
Do his eyes also have decision fatigue?

24:08.680 --> 24:12.000
It's so nice to eat hot wontons
on a rainy day.

24:50.720 --> 24:51.680
What's wrong?

24:54.080 --> 24:56.000
The editors arranged a dinner for artists.

24:56.080 --> 24:57.200
There's a rival

24:57.280 --> 24:59.960
who'd play nasty tricks
every time we meet.

25:00.040 --> 25:01.360
I heard she got engaged.

25:01.440 --> 25:03.400
She'll definitely try every means
to insult me.

25:03.480 --> 25:04.480
You don't want to go?

25:05.400 --> 25:06.800
Why should I give up this opportunity

25:06.880 --> 25:07.920
just because of her?

25:08.520 --> 25:10.920
Not only will I go,
but I will dress up for it

25:11.000 --> 25:11.920
and piss her off.

25:14.440 --> 25:15.280
Come here.

25:19.200 --> 25:21.480
This is called parrotfish.

25:21.560 --> 25:22.560
Parrotfish?

25:23.160 --> 25:24.160
Because they're

25:24.240 --> 25:26.160
as colorful as a parrot's feathers.

25:26.240 --> 25:28.000
Its formal name is blackspot razorfish.

25:28.600 --> 25:29.840
That fish is so pretty.

25:33.440 --> 25:34.520
It's called angelfish

25:34.600 --> 25:36.080
because it swims smoothly,

25:36.160 --> 25:37.480
like an angel.

25:38.080 --> 25:40.520
It's from the family Cichlidae.

25:40.600 --> 25:44.760
There are Bluespotted Angelfish,

25:44.840 --> 25:48.800
Freshwater Angelfish,
and Albino Red Eye Angelfish.

25:49.400 --> 25:50.840
What is this one?

25:53.400 --> 25:56.960
It's kissing fish or kissing gouramis,
because they like to kiss each other.

25:58.200 --> 25:59.360
So romantic.

26:01.720 --> 26:03.480
The two fish that were kissing

26:03.560 --> 26:04.720
are both male.

26:04.800 --> 26:08.160
The kissing behavior
is also between same-sex fish.

26:09.160 --> 26:11.120
- Is there a problem?
- No.

26:11.800 --> 26:14.320
I mean, they don't kiss each other

26:14.400 --> 26:16.240
out of friendship or love,

26:16.320 --> 26:17.520
but…

26:20.160 --> 26:21.240
for fighting.

26:22.480 --> 26:25.080
Do you mean they were fighting?

26:27.160 --> 26:29.080
We naturally consider

26:29.160 --> 26:31.240
kissing fish as a symbol of love,

26:31.320 --> 26:32.520
but when

26:33.080 --> 26:34.800
two kissing fish meet,

26:34.880 --> 26:38.680
they will instinctively extend

26:38.760 --> 26:40.040
their serrated lips

26:40.120 --> 26:42.640
to collide forcefully with each other

26:42.720 --> 26:43.920
to protect their territory

26:44.520 --> 26:45.960
until one of them retreats.

26:48.920 --> 26:51.560
Pride and prejudice are everywhere.

26:52.280 --> 26:53.880
Humans are so arrogant.

26:53.960 --> 26:56.080
Not only we, but also fish have

26:56.160 --> 26:57.960
to bear others' misunderstanding
and prejudice.

26:59.440 --> 27:01.440
No matter how humans
interpret their meaning,

27:01.520 --> 27:02.560
they're always being themselves.

27:02.640 --> 27:03.720
You're right.

27:03.800 --> 27:06.120
We only need to try to be ourselves.

27:06.200 --> 27:07.760
Other people's interpretation
doesn't matter.

27:12.960 --> 27:14.760
Do you know something?

27:14.840 --> 27:16.160
Do you know my rival?

27:16.240 --> 27:18.520
I swear I don't know anything or anyone.

27:19.520 --> 27:22.000
However, disputes between humans

27:22.080 --> 27:23.440
are pretty much the same.

27:24.040 --> 27:26.120
For fame and interest,
out of pride and prejudice.

27:26.200 --> 27:27.400
Didn't you say it yourself?

27:28.600 --> 27:30.560
Well said. You can write a book.

27:32.000 --> 27:34.520
You're the real expert here.

27:34.600 --> 27:36.600
I'm so flattered.

27:55.600 --> 27:56.560
Hello, Lin Yuan.

27:57.160 --> 27:58.480
I suddenly got my period

27:58.560 --> 28:00.000
and I got caught in the rain.

28:00.080 --> 28:02.600
My stomach hurts, and I want to go home.

28:02.680 --> 28:03.880
Can you pick me up?

28:04.560 --> 28:06.320
Where are you? I'm coming.

28:07.240 --> 28:08.280
Tang Qi's place.

28:08.360 --> 28:09.200
You're…

28:13.440 --> 28:15.320
Humans are worse than fish.

28:16.400 --> 28:17.400
What?

28:17.480 --> 28:20.120
I mean, humans' pride and prejudice

28:20.200 --> 28:21.400
are despicable.

28:22.200 --> 28:23.800
It's an emergency. Hurry up.

28:24.400 --> 28:25.440
I'm coming.

28:26.200 --> 28:27.600
My friend is in trouble.
I need to save her.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.680
- See you next time.
- I--

28:34.080 --> 28:36.000
She clearly doesn't like you.

28:36.080 --> 28:38.960
Gu Yu, I never expected
this would happen to you.

28:39.040 --> 28:41.760
You're not fish,
so how do you know if they are happy?

28:46.960 --> 28:47.880
Hello.

28:48.600 --> 28:49.800
My phone was on silent mode,

28:49.880 --> 28:51.000
so I didn't hear it.

28:52.440 --> 28:53.400
Okay, I'm coming.

28:59.600 --> 29:00.680
Are you going home?

29:01.480 --> 29:03.160
Tang Qi needs me. I'm going to his house.

29:03.240 --> 29:04.880
I'm also going there. Same direction.

29:06.320 --> 29:07.360
Why don't we…?

29:10.800 --> 29:12.200
Be careful.

29:23.320 --> 29:24.560
We can't be in the same car.

29:34.800 --> 29:36.000
What's wrong?

29:36.640 --> 29:38.040
My car ran out of fuel.

29:38.840 --> 29:40.360
Can you give me a ride?

29:41.360 --> 29:42.440
Yes.

29:44.120 --> 29:45.320
Su Chengcheng.

29:45.400 --> 29:46.760
Are you not feeling well?

29:50.920 --> 29:51.800
Su Chengcheng.

29:58.560 --> 30:01.080
My… My stomach hurts.

30:01.920 --> 30:03.040
You should rest. Give it to me.

30:03.120 --> 30:04.560
- No need!
- Come on.

30:08.040 --> 30:09.120
It's okay.

30:15.840 --> 30:18.440
Did he see it or not?

30:18.520 --> 30:20.880
You're weak and easy to get sick,

30:20.960 --> 30:22.240
so you need to be more careful.

30:22.320 --> 30:23.720
Don't get caught in the rain.

30:24.920 --> 30:26.360
I'm pretty healthy.

30:26.440 --> 30:28.280
This is an accident.

30:28.360 --> 30:30.960
I promise
I won't take a day off on Monday.

30:32.400 --> 30:33.840
You can rest if you need to.

30:33.920 --> 30:35.120
Don't push yourself.

30:38.000 --> 30:40.160
Quan Shengtang, the person
who crashed you in tennis,

30:40.240 --> 30:41.760
was me.

30:51.800 --> 30:54.080
If you don't feel well, go home early.

30:54.160 --> 30:55.720
I called a premier car on DiDi.

30:56.400 --> 30:58.560
It's more comfortable.
It's about to arrive.

30:58.640 --> 31:00.120
When did you call it?

31:01.120 --> 31:02.680
When you were drying your hair.

31:04.200 --> 31:05.600
You're always so thoughtful.

31:06.640 --> 31:08.760
But I already asked
Lin Yuan to pick me up.

31:09.360 --> 31:11.240
Gu Yu said her car ran out of fuel.

31:13.440 --> 31:17.200
How did he know that?

31:19.800 --> 31:22.240
They're here. You can ask her.

31:33.280 --> 31:35.560
When did you two become so close?

31:36.320 --> 31:37.880
Long story.

31:38.560 --> 31:40.160
Gu Yu is warm-hearted

31:40.240 --> 31:41.640
and always free on weekends,

31:41.720 --> 31:43.640
so he often helps me collect materials.

31:44.160 --> 31:45.880
Gu Yu is warm-hearted

31:45.960 --> 31:47.960
and free on weekends?

31:48.040 --> 31:50.440
Are we talking about the same person?

31:51.960 --> 31:53.560
It doesn't matter.

31:53.640 --> 31:55.960
What happened to you?

31:56.040 --> 31:57.400
You tried so hard

31:57.480 --> 32:00.520
to make Fang Jin disappear.

32:01.360 --> 32:04.280
However, you didn't draw lines with him

32:04.360 --> 32:07.320
but went to his house.

32:07.880 --> 32:10.000
I was afraid that he wanted to die,

32:10.080 --> 32:12.160
so I took him home.

32:13.200 --> 32:15.680
Tang Qi wanted to die?

32:16.920 --> 32:19.480
Are we talking about the same person?

32:21.520 --> 32:23.120
Maybe I overthought it.

32:23.800 --> 32:26.080
But he's been weird.
Something must be wrong.

32:47.840 --> 32:49.640
Stop staring at me.
You're making me nervous.

33:04.120 --> 33:06.360
Who got in the car first?

33:08.440 --> 33:09.480
Su Chengcheng.

33:13.600 --> 33:14.760
Good guess.

33:18.600 --> 33:19.600
I didn't guess it.

33:20.200 --> 33:21.360
I saw it.

33:23.480 --> 33:24.560
My eyes

33:25.560 --> 33:28.160
can only see the color
of Su Chengcheng now.

33:29.840 --> 33:31.480
Your eyes can only see

33:31.560 --> 33:33.280
the color of Su Chengcheng?

33:36.520 --> 33:37.560
What does it mean?

33:56.160 --> 33:57.840
OPHTHALMOLOGY EXAM REPORT

33:58.800 --> 34:00.480
The fundus

34:02.120 --> 34:03.280
is fine.

34:04.360 --> 34:05.400
And the cornea

34:07.200 --> 34:08.280
has no problem.

34:08.880 --> 34:10.120
You're healthy.

34:15.159 --> 34:16.040
Tang,

34:17.520 --> 34:19.560
have you faced stressful situations

34:20.199 --> 34:22.800
in your work and life recently?

34:24.080 --> 34:25.000
What do you mean?

34:26.239 --> 34:27.080
Here's the thing.

34:27.760 --> 34:29.400
A patient once

34:29.480 --> 34:30.960
suddenly became blind.

34:31.040 --> 34:32.600
However, according to the exam results,

34:32.679 --> 34:34.000
it was because

34:34.080 --> 34:36.520
the graduate entrance examination
was too stressful.

34:37.120 --> 34:40.280
Your eyes haven't shown
any organic lesions.

34:40.360 --> 34:41.880
Given this situation,

34:41.960 --> 34:43.920
I think it was caused
by your mental health.

34:44.639 --> 34:46.320
I suggest you find a psychiatrist

34:46.400 --> 34:48.440
to get mental treatment.

34:49.760 --> 34:52.159
But it's not that I can't see any colors.

34:53.719 --> 34:56.120
I can see the color of a colleague.

34:56.840 --> 34:58.720
No matter what object she touches,

34:59.720 --> 35:01.760
I can see the color of that thing.

35:06.080 --> 35:07.840
I'm not a psychiatrist,

35:07.920 --> 35:09.800
so I can't explain this.

35:11.440 --> 35:13.680
But I think this is related
to your subconscious mind.

35:13.760 --> 35:17.120
Maybe it wants to tell you something.

35:18.040 --> 35:19.200
Maybe this person is the key

35:19.280 --> 35:21.520
to curing your eyes.

35:22.120 --> 35:23.520
If it's possible,

35:23.600 --> 35:25.880
you can try to interact more
with this person

35:25.960 --> 35:28.360
to see if it can get better.

35:40.400 --> 35:42.520
Doctor Chen asked you
to interact more with Su Chengcheng,

35:42.600 --> 35:44.280
so give it a try.

35:44.360 --> 35:46.160
Su Chengcheng is not a monster.

35:46.240 --> 35:47.760
You can make friends with her.

35:47.840 --> 35:48.840
Don't be so reluctant.

35:49.600 --> 35:51.480
I'm not reluctant.

35:52.720 --> 35:54.720
I used to be biased against her,

35:55.800 --> 35:57.520
but now she's completely changed.

35:57.600 --> 35:58.760
She's different.

36:00.120 --> 36:02.960
You were biased against her?

36:03.040 --> 36:04.040
Why?

36:04.120 --> 36:06.760
Tell me about your youth.

36:06.840 --> 36:08.720
This is about my eyes.

36:08.800 --> 36:10.360
Why are you always gossiping?

36:11.560 --> 36:13.840
Doctor Chen said maybe Su Chengcheng

36:13.920 --> 36:15.760
is the key to curing your eyes.

36:15.840 --> 36:17.160
I just want

36:17.240 --> 36:18.880
to find that lock for you.

36:20.040 --> 36:22.120
Doctor Chen is an ophthalmologist,

36:23.080 --> 36:24.560
not a psychiatrist.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.480
Then tell me.

36:26.560 --> 36:29.080
Why can you only see
the color of Su Chengcheng?

36:35.960 --> 36:36.880
I don't know.

37:00.600 --> 37:02.560
Didn't you say you were busy?

37:03.400 --> 37:05.520
Why are you treating us to a meal?

37:05.600 --> 37:07.360
I'm in trouble right now

37:07.440 --> 37:09.000
and want you to help me
confirm the result.

37:09.080 --> 37:11.000
What trouble?

37:11.080 --> 37:12.520
Do you need our help?

37:12.600 --> 37:13.960
- No need.
- He can handle it.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.360
By the way,

37:20.440 --> 37:22.480
didn't you say you want us

37:22.560 --> 37:23.800
to help you confirm the result?

37:23.880 --> 37:26.200
Have you got the result?

37:28.080 --> 37:29.360
I've figured it out.

37:45.680 --> 37:46.720
I met you,

37:48.240 --> 37:49.400
Zhou Jinli,

37:50.040 --> 37:51.480
and my parents.

37:52.080 --> 37:53.200
My best friend,

37:53.800 --> 37:55.520
my closest work partner,

37:55.600 --> 37:56.920
and my family

37:57.760 --> 37:59.440
are colorless in my eyes.

38:00.040 --> 38:01.680
Don't worry. You'll be fine.

38:04.120 --> 38:06.080
I'm not reluctant
to get along with Su Chengcheng.

38:06.160 --> 38:07.920
I just don't understand.

38:08.440 --> 38:09.840
Why is it Su Chengcheng?

38:10.680 --> 38:12.240
Why is it only her?

38:31.320 --> 38:32.160
Stop!

38:32.240 --> 38:33.400
Stop the car!
